  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TaleStoneData
  DialogueLines:
  - textVI: "Ngh\u1ECBch thi\xEAn c\u1EA3i m\u1EC7nh sao... Hahaha c\xE2u n\xE0y
      vi\u1EBFt r\u1EA5t hay."
    textEN: To defy heaven to change destiny... hahahaha, how beautifully absurd.
    AutoSkip: 0
  - textVI: "Vindi ta, s\u1EBD h\u1EE7y di\u1EC7t c\u1EA3 th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi n\xE0y!
      L\u0169 s\xF3c kh\u1ED1n khi\u1EBFp h\xE3y \u0111\u1EE3i ng\xE0y ta kh\u1EA3i
      ho\xE0n tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1!"
    textEN: '"I, Vindi, shall destroy this entire world! You wretched squirrels,
      just wait for the day of my triumphant return!"'
    AutoSkip: 0
